  "findings": [
    "Loader48 refuses fixed namespace and descendant collisions before source reads and again before registration; reads canonical regular bounded actual D/G, pins whole D and whole G normalized only at one strict PENDING-or-lowerhex64 seal assignment. Both bodies verify before either executes. It executes actual verified raw bytes, aliases sys.modules[loader] to the actual guard and preserves function/global/POLICY identity. No facade or production seal assignment. Import bootstrap reads only trusted source, not application context.",
    "Controller dispatches extend old .9/.10 proof paths to .11 through actual G. Current reader requires .11 and exact60 paths (old48 plus12 disjoint additions). Generic amendment/lock/family/schema checks retain specific-error ordering before full G validation. Existing old and new validation layers remain. Actual G exports every imported API.",
    "Generator applies source-next record_updates after preparation/storage layers, skipping only expanded_implementation_inputs recomputed by the existing complete closure logic. Complete graph/waves/conflicts/brief/team dispatch algorithms remain. Final whole-plan CLI-to-fresh-oracle equality remains a runtime/data gate.",
    "Old storage/preparation tests first restore live .11 to whole .10, then run unchanged S/P negative controls. Team case checks797 assignments including all three additions. Guard default reader stops synthetic seal and checks whole .10 restoration from physical live .11; original absent-lane and missing-callback controls remain.",
    "Constructor test bootstrap hash matches new guard-test bytes. Fixed checkpoint priors preserve exact .10 raw lock/register/snapshot instead of reading mutable live priors. Staged logical claims and test-only seal remain scoped. Physical-positive case stops test seal and requires exact live lock plus full register/snapshot equality; scoped loader-only Path.is_file refusal retains missing-role negative. No test identities removed or renamed.",
    "Driver44 whole-pins loader1819 before import and uses its actual D/G package. Calls only fixed six-input D.derive with bounded fixed capsule/provenance/lane/amendment, actual final generator708982b09860061a0108328877e15f7b3a66c13e2adfd9ef9fe224384ce1be4c and actual CURRENT owner. No G validation API, seal assignment, generator CLI or install. Exactly five artifacts plus manifest; support hashes bind driver/loader/actual guard. Actual encoded outputs plus raw/framed support must fit already-admitted D proposal envelope; D inputs plus envelope are independently limited64MiB. Fresh canonical owned direct B43 child,0700 and exclusive file writes.",
    "Current active contract remains1.0.10, old48lock and1167snapshot roles, while G is exact PENDING. Transitional source is intentionally not represented as an already-valid .11 active model; absent adoption outputs are not a defect in the unsigned-derive source gate."
  ],
